<title>USA: Minn. jobless rate in Feb. lowest ever - governor.</title>
<headline>Minn. jobless rate in Feb. lowest ever - governor.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota recorded its lowest monthly unemployment rate on record in February, Gov. Arne Carlson announced Thursday.</p>
<p>The three percent seasonally adjusted jobless rate was down from the state's 3.5 percent rate in January and 3.8 percent rate in February 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;This is another indication that the state's economy is continuing to grow at a strong, healthy pace,&quot; Carlson said in a news release.</p>
<p>((--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647))</p>
</text>
